'''Perfection of Het''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete [[Perfect Het]] and [[Perfect Akkha]] in a single run of the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid at raid level 300 or above.

==Strategy==
[[Perfect Het]] and [[Perfect Akkha]] do not need to be completed in succession. As death invocations do not need to be enabled, players that complete Perfect Het and then fail Perfect Akkha can all die and re-attempt Perfect Akkha without having to redo Perfect Het.

